{1080}{37l Me And My Automaton}

//-------------------------------------------------------
// As It Is Written - Book of Prophecies
//-------------------------------------------------------
{1090}{497c


As It Is Written

Jerald Ornaye

}
{1091}{497l
   I write these as I have seen them in my visions. For some reason unbeknownst to me, my studies have allowed me to glimpse time before that time has come.





   I know not what these visions are, nor how to make sense of them. I merely write what I have seen in the hope that some day, a traveller unbeknownst to me shall read them and understand them and use this knowledge for the purposes of good.



And there shall be a Builder,
And his name shall be Bob.
And he will bring much joy to the children when he sings,
But the Posh Spice shall be afraid of the Builder,
And will resent the Builders success.
And the Spice will attempt to drive the Builder away,
By being not such an innocent girl.
But the Spice shall fail,
And retreat into its castle,
With pink walls and flowers.
And the Spice will gain consolence from Football.


And there shall be a white fire.
And it shall fall from the sky and rise from the ground.
And there, a mushroom will grow.
And it will be a great mushroom.
A mushroom such as the world has never seen.
But the mushroom will soon vanish.
And the white fire shall soon vanish.
But many will be dead.

}
{1092}{497l
And there shall be lockers deep beneath the earth,
And the locker-dwellers shall survive the white fire.
And shall return to the surface
And shall try to rebuild their lost world.
Except for one such group.
Who will send out but one person.
And that person will be the Chosen One.
And the Chosen One shall seek water,
But will not seek water.
And the Chosen One shall travel many long and hard journeys.
And the Chosen One will suffer much pain.
But the Chosen One will prevail.
And will rid the world of altered humans.
But the Chosen One shall be banished from the locker.
And will die in the great waste.


And there shall be a return of the locker-dweller.
In the guise of descendants.
Who shall send out the Chosen One in search of food.
But the Chosen One shall suffer much pain.
But the pain shall be from lack of story-line,
And half-arsed endings.
And cobbled together plots and lack of character depth.
But the Chosen One will prevail.
And the Chosen One will enjoy the journey regardless.
And the Chosen One will ask for a third journey.



}
{1093}{497l
And there shall be a third journey for the Chosen One.
But it will not be a third journey.
Even so the journey will be harsh.
For the journey will be 14 Degrees East of the Micro Fort.
And the Chosen One will struggle on this journey.
But will attempt to perservere none-the-less.
Until the Chosen One discovers the Troika God.
And listens to the prophecies of Cain and Anderson and
Boyarsky and Bragg and Harrison and Jones and McCarthy
and Moore and Moret and Park and Reynolds and Shellman.
And the Chosen One shall retire from this journey.
But will eagerly await the true third journey.

And wait..... And wait.....

And there shall be a God named Yal'pretni.
And it shall be an evil god.
For the god will make heinous enjoyment.
Such as the third descent.
Which shall be bought cheaply,
Bundled with the second freespace.
And the freespace shall be fun,
But the third descent shall be old and boring.
And the third descent should have been left after the second descent.
But the evil God Yal'pretni will not listen.
For greed will consume the God.
And the God shall lust for money and gold and many followers.
And to achieve these followers the God shall commit heinous crimes.

}
{1094}{497l 
And Yal'pretni shall create the true third journey.
Which the God will create for the Chosen One.
But the Chosen One shall be dubious.
For the true third journey shall be in the third dimension.
And it shall be first person.
And it shall involve shooting them up,
With the Chosen Ones rifle of plasma.
And the hardcore followers shall love the journey.
For they are daft and nieve and simple minded.
But the large group of followers shall be turned away by the journey in the third dimension.
For it shall not offer as much as the quake.
And it shall not offer as much as the Troika God.
And so it will be stuck in limbo.
And the followers shall abandon Yal'pretni.
And the God shall be left to wither and die,
But it will fight to live.
For its next release will be the fourth descent,
For it shall not be torn.


And the Great God Titus shall consume Yal'pretni.
And Yal'pretni shall try to appease its new masters.
But Yal'pretni shall fail.
For Yal'pretni shall not be by gamers for gamers.
It shall be by gold hungry demons for the masses.
And Yal'pretni shall learn a harsh lesson of life.
And that lesson shall echo in the Gods ears for eternity.
But it will be too late.
For the echo will reverberate around the once giant Yal'pretnis' corpse.
For Yal'pretni shall be dead.
But the Chosen One shall still hope for the long awaited journey.
And shall hope for the rights of Yal'pretni to be salvaged from the ruins.
And shall hope that the God Troika shall make the long awaited journey.
And that the journey will be improved with much greatness and pride.
For all the Chosen One shall have left is hope...}


